# Every environment variable Zero Sum reads, one per line: NAME  required|optional|tool  what it is.
# A test (tests/test_deploy.py) holds this list to the code: a variable the code reads must be listed here, and a
# listed variable must be read. A host's setup script should write `required` ones into the container's env file and
# may pass `optional` ones through. Values are documented in README.md "Configuration" and .env.example.
DATABASE_URL            required  postgresql://iz_unified:<password>@<db host>:5432/<db>; the role grants.sql creates
EMAIL_ENCRYPT_SECRET    required  same value as Inbox Zero's: decrypts the Google tokens it stores
EMAIL_ENCRYPT_SALT      required  same value as Inbox Zero's
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID        required  same OAuth client as Inbox Zero: refreshes access tokens
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET    required  same OAuth client as Inbox Zero
ALLOWED_EMAILS          required  comma-separated addresses that may sign in
CF_ACCESS_TEAM_DOMAIN   required  Cloudflare Access team domain; with CF_ACCESS_AUD the signed token is verified. The app refuses to start without both unless ALLOW_HEADER_TRUST=1
CF_ACCESS_AUD           required  the Access application's AUD tag
ALLOW_HEADER_TRUST      optional  1 = start without token verification and believe AUTH_EMAIL_HEADER (local development only)
AUTH_EMAIL_HEADER       optional  header read only with ALLOW_HEADER_TRUST=1
LISTEN_HOST             optional  bind address; default 127.0.0.1, the image sets 0.0.0.0
PORT                    optional  default 8080
ACCOUNT_OWNERS          optional  Inbox Zero user ids / login e-mails whose mailboxes are used; default all
MASTER_EMAIL            optional  account whose Inbox Zero rules can be shared; empty = rule sync off
INBOX_ZERO_URL          optional  for the links to Inbox Zero
OPENROUTER_API_KEY      optional  AI features; empty = hidden
AI_MODEL                optional
AI_BASE_URL             optional
AI_MAX_CALLS_PER_DAY    optional
AI_PLANS_PER_RUN        optional
AI_MIN_EMAILS           optional
AI_SORT_RETRIES         optional
COLLECT_EVERY_MIN       optional
RULES_EVERY_MIN         optional
RULES_AUTO_MAX_DELETES  optional  most rule copies the automatic sync deletes per run (default 3)
BACKFILL_DAYS           optional
BACKFILL_STEP           optional
GMAIL_UNITS_PER_SEC     optional
QUARANTINE_LABEL        optional
QUARANTINE_SHOW         optional
MAX_BULK                optional
PREVIEW_MAX             optional
ADMIN_DATABASE_URL      tool      only for `python app.py init-db`: Inbox Zero's database owner connection
INBOX_ZERO_REPO         tool      only for tools/check_upstream.py
